  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central African Republic (CAR) Humanitarian funding to Central Africans, IDPs and Refugees 2014-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond to the humanitarian crisis in the Central African Republic (CAR) by providing refugees and IDPs from the Central African Republic with healthcare, food security, shelter and livelihoods programmes . This will help address the immediate humanitarian needs in CAR and in neighbouring Cameroon and Chad. This contributes to our MDGs by supporting food security and reducing child mortality.</narrative>
  </description>
